---

Intended use: JOCKY is a defensive/forensic tool. Use it only on systems you
are authorised to investigate. The polymorphic and fileless features exist to
keep investigative tooling from being blocked by endpoint protection on hosts
under lawful examination; they are documented, measured and mirrored by the
detection library that ships in the same package.
